So my Gnomish Ranger who had the incident with the BoH, got back on
his feet.  Finished the quest.  Went on down and found the VibSq.
Having nothing else to to do, starting the Ascension Run seemed like
the right thing to do.

Well only problem was in the fight with big O, that stupid hammer
zapped the /oDeath.  So our hero doesn't have a /oD.  Waking the
wizard up without one, was just Stupid (with a capital-S).

But he still got the book.  Had a little trouble with the ritual, but
eventually the staircase appeared.  Serious trouble with the high
priest, but eventually our hero clutched the amulet in his hands.

Run Run Run.

Ooops there's the pesky wizard again.  What's this double trouble
stuff?  Gah there's two of him now.  Monsters everywhere, time to whip
out Magicbane and engrave the E-word.  "Your Magicbane gets dull"
WTF?!?  Oh I see some battle with an L ended up with it cursed.
Grrrr. Only solution at this point is to read a ?oTele

While reading the scroll, one Wizard escapes upstairs.  Our hero finds
himself on Medusa's island (up about 10 or so levels from where he
was) with the other Wizard.

Eventually this 2nd Wizard is defeated.  And that's when it dawns on
me, I thought level teleport was blocked if you had the Amulet.  Oh I
see our hero doesn't have it any more.

Ok the amulet  is lost.  Magicbane needs to be fixed.  In fact with
its ability to block the curses, I'm thinking Magicbane is going to
become the primary weapon replacing the big-M hammer.

So back up to the lowest level alter.  #offer and #pray a lot.
Finally get Magicbane up to +0.  Then I get the bright idea, use the
last wish from the Castle Wand and get a /oDeath.

Do that and now our hero is back at the Gates of Gehennom.

